<div style="text-align:left;text-align-last:auto;margin-bottom:9px;margin-left:0px;margin-top:0px;margin-right:0px;"><font style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:#000000;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">This </font><font style="font-family:'Fidelity Futura Std Bold',Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:#000000;font-style:normal;font-weight:bold;">example</font><font style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:13px;color:#000000;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> helps compare the cost of investing in the fund with the cost of investing in other funds.</font></div>
